{"subject":"math3","year":2017,"count":23,"origin":"source","generator":"tools/work/build_analysis_from_blocks.py（source_blocks 原文照录，零编造）","analysis":[{"id":"math3-2017-1","num":1,"desc":"分段函数的连续性","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】A","【解析】$f(0+0)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0^{+}}\\dfrac{1-\\cos\\sqrt{x}}{ax}=\\dfrac{1}{2a}$，$f(0)=f(0-0)=b$，","因为 $f(x)$ 在 $x=0$ 处连续，所以 $f(0+0)=f(0)=f(0-0)$，从而 $ab=\\dfrac{1}{2}$，应选（A）"]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-2","num":2,"desc":"二元函数的极值","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】D","【解析】由 $\\begin{cases}z'_{x}=3y-2xy-y^{2}=0\\\\ z'_{y}=3x-2xy-x^{2}=0\\end{cases}$，得 $\\begin{cases}x=0\\\\ y=0\\end{cases}$，$\\begin{cases}x=1\\\\ y=1\\end{cases}$，$\\begin{cases}x=0\\\\ y=3\\end{cases}$，$\\begin{cases}x=3\\\\ y=0\\end{cases}$，","$z''_{xx}=-2y$，$z''_{xy}=3-2x-2y$，$z''_{yy}=-2x$，","当 $(x,y)=(0,0),(0,3),(3,0)$ 时，$AC-B^{2}<0$ 成立，则都不是极值点；","当 $(x,y)=(1,1)$ 时，$AC-B^{2}=3>0$ 且 $A=-2<0$，则 $(1,1)$ 为极值点，应选（D）."]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-3","num":3,"desc":"导数符号与函数单调性","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】C","【解析】若 $f(x)>0$，则 $f'(x)>0$，从而 $f(1)>f(-1)>0$；","若 $f(x)<0$，则 $f'(x)<0$，从而 $f(1)<f(-1)<0$，故 $|f(1)|>|f(-1)|$，应选（C）","方法二：令 $F(x)=f^{2}(x)$，则 $F'(x)=2f(x)f'(x)>0$，所以 $F(x)$ 单调递增.","故 $F(1)>F(-1)$，即 $f^{2}(1)>f^{2}(-1)$，可得 $|f(1)|>|f(-1)|$，选 C."]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-4","num":4,"desc":"泰勒展开","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】C","【解析】$\\sin x=x-\\dfrac{1}{6}x^{3}+o\\left(x^{3}\\right)$ 得 $\\sin\\dfrac{1}{n}=\\dfrac{1}{n}-\\dfrac{1}{6n^{3}}+o\\left(\\dfrac{1}{n^{3}}\\right)$，","由 $\\ln(1+x)=x-\\dfrac{x^{2}}{2}+o\\left(x^{2}\\right)$ 得 $\\ln\\left(1-\\dfrac{1}{n}\\right)=-\\dfrac{1}{n}-\\dfrac{1}{2n^{2}}+o\\left(\\dfrac{1}{n^{2}}\\right)$，","于是 $\\sin\\dfrac{1}{n}-k\\ln\\left(1-\\dfrac{1}{n}\\right)=(k+1)\\dfrac{1}{n}+\\dfrac{k}{2n^{2}}+o\\left(\\dfrac{1}{n^{2}}\\right)$，","由 $\\sum\\limits_{n=2}^{\\infty}\\left[\\sin\\dfrac{1}{n}-k\\ln\\left(1-\\dfrac{1}{n}\\right)\\right]$ 收敛得 $k=-1$，应选（C）"]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-5","num":5,"desc":"矩阵的特征值","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】A","【解析】令 $\\boldsymbol{A}=\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}^{T}$，$\\boldsymbol{A}^{2}=\\boldsymbol{A}$，","令 $\\boldsymbol{AX}=\\lambda\\boldsymbol{X}$，由 $(\\boldsymbol{A}^{2}-\\boldsymbol{A})\\boldsymbol{X}=(\\lambda^{2}-\\lambda)\\boldsymbol{X}=\\boldsymbol{0}$ 得 $\\lambda^{2}-\\lambda=0$，$\\lambda=0$ 或 $\\lambda=1$，","因为 $tr(\\boldsymbol{A})=\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}^{T}\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}=1=\\lambda_{1}+\\cdots+\\lambda_{n}$ 得 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 的特征值为 $\\lambda_{1}=\\cdots=\\lambda_{n-1}=0,\\lambda_{n}=1$","$\\boldsymbol{E}-\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}^{T}$ 的特征值为 $\\lambda_{1}=\\cdots=\\lambda_{n-1}=1$，$\\lambda_{n}=0$,从而 $\\left|\\boldsymbol{E}-\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}^{T}\\right|=0$，","即 $\\boldsymbol{E}-\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}^{T}$ 不可逆，应选（A）."]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-6","num":6,"desc":"相似对角化的判定","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】B","【解析】$\\boldsymbol{A},\\boldsymbol{B},\\boldsymbol{C}$ 的特征值为 $\\lambda_{1}=\\lambda_{2}=2,\\lambda_{3}=1$，","由 $2\\boldsymbol{E}-\\boldsymbol{A}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&0&0\\\\ 0&0&-1\\\\ 0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}$ 得 $r(2\\boldsymbol{E}-\\boldsymbol{A})=1$，则 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 可相似对角化，从而 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 与 $\\boldsymbol{C}$ 相似；","由 $2\\boldsymbol{E}-\\boldsymbol{B}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&-1&0\\\\ 0&0&0\\\\ 0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}$ 得 $r(2\\boldsymbol{E}-\\boldsymbol{B})=2$，则 $\\boldsymbol{B}$ 不可相似对角化，从而 $\\boldsymbol{B}$ 与 $\\boldsymbol{A},\\boldsymbol{C}$ 不相似；应选（B）."]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-7","num":7,"desc":"事件独立性","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】C","【解析】","$P\\left[(A+B)C\\right]=P\\left[AC+BC\\right]=P(AC)+P(BC)-P(ABC)$","$=P(A)P(C)+P(B)P(C)-P(ABC)$，","$P(A+B)P(C)=\\left[P(A)+P(B)-P(AB)\\right]P(C)$","$=P(A)P(C)+P(B)P(C)-P(AB)P(C)$","$A\\cup B$ 与 $C$ 独立即 $P\\left[(A+B)C\\right]=P(A+B)P(C)$ 的充分必要条件为","$P(A)P(C)+P(B)P(C)-P(ABC)=P(A)P(C)+P(B)P(C)-P(AB)P(C)$，","$P(ABC)=P(AB)P(C)$，即 $AB$ 与 $C$ 独立，应选（C）"]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-8","num":8,"desc":"正态总体的抽样分布","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】B","【解析】若总体 $X\\sim N(\\mu,\\sigma^{2})$，则 $\\dfrac{1}{\\sigma^{2}}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}(X_{i}-\\mu)^{2}\\sim\\chi^{2}(n)$，","$\\dfrac{1}{\\sigma^{2}}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}(X_{i}-\\overline{X})^{2}\\sim\\chi^{2}(n-1)$，因为总体 $X\\sim N(\\mu,1)$，所以 $\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}(X_{i}-\\mu)^{2}\\sim\\chi^{2}(n)$","$\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}(X_{i}-\\overline{X})^{2}\\sim\\chi^{2}(n-1)$，再由 $\\overline{X}\\sim N\\left(\\mu,\\dfrac{1}{n}\\right)$ 得 $\\dfrac{\\overline{X}-\\mu}{\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{n}}}=\\sqrt{n}(\\overline{X}-\\mu)\\sim N(0,1)$","从而 $n(\\overline{X}-\\mu)^{2}\\sim\\chi^{2}(1)$，不正确的是（B），应选（B）"]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-9","num":9,"desc":"定积分的对称性","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\dfrac{\\pi^{3}}{2}$.","【解析】$\\displaystyle\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}\\left(\\sin^{3}x+\\sqrt{\\pi^{2}-x^{2}}\\right)dx=\\int_{-\\pi}^{\\pi}\\sqrt{\\pi^{2}-x^{2}}dx$","$=2\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{\\pi}\\sqrt{\\pi^{2}-x^{2}}dx\\xlongequal{x=\\pi\\sin t}2\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\pi^{2}\\cos^{2}tdt$","$=2\\pi^{2}\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\cos^{2}tdt=\\dfrac{\\pi^{3}}{2}.$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-10","num":10,"desc":"一阶线性差分方程","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$C2^{t}+\\dfrac{1}{2}t2^{t}$，$C$ 为任意常数.","【解析】$y_{t+1}-2y_{t}=0$ 的通解为 $y_{t}=C2^{t}$；设 $y_{t+1}-2y_{t}=2^{t}$ 的特解为 $y^{*}=at2^{t}$，代入得 $a=\\dfrac{1}{2}$，故 $y_{t+1}-2y_{t}=2^{t}$ 的通解为 $y_{t}=C2^{t}+\\dfrac{1}{2}t2^{t}$，$C$ 为任意常数."]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-11","num":11,"desc":"平均成本与总成本","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$1+e^{-Q}-Qe^{-Q}$.","【解析】平均成本为 $\\overline{C}(Q)=\\dfrac{C(Q)}{Q}=1+e^{-Q}$，总成本为 $C(Q)=Q+Qe^{-Q}$，边际成本为 $C'(Q)=1+(1-Q)e^{-Q}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-12","num":12,"desc":"全微分与原函数","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$xye^{y}$.","【解析】由 $df(x,y)=ye^{y}dx+x(1+y)e^{y}dy=d(xye^{y})$ 得 $f(x,y)=xye^{y}+C$，","再由 $f(0,0)=0$ 得 $C=0$，故 $f(x,y)=xye^{y}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-13","num":13,"desc":"矩阵的秩","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】2","【解析】$(\\boldsymbol{A\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{A\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{A\\alpha}_{3})=\\boldsymbol{A}(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3})$.","因为 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}$ 线性无关，所以 $(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3})$ 可逆.从而 $r(\\boldsymbol{A\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{A\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{A\\alpha}_{3})=r(\\boldsymbol{A})$.","由 $\\boldsymbol{A}\\to\\begin{bmatrix}1&0&1\\\\ 0&1&1\\\\ 0&0&0\\end{bmatrix}$ 得 $r(\\boldsymbol{A})=2$，故向量组 $\\boldsymbol{A\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{A\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{A\\alpha}_{3}$ 的秩为 2."]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-14","num":14,"desc":"离散型随机变量的期望与方差","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\dfrac{9}{2}$.","【解析】$EX=-1+a+3b=0$，再由 $\\dfrac{1}{2}+a+b=1$ 得 $a=b=\\dfrac{1}{4}$，","$EX^{2}=(-2)^{2}\\times\\dfrac{1}{2}+1^{2}\\times\\dfrac{1}{4}+3^{2}\\times\\dfrac{1}{4}=\\dfrac{9}{2}$ 所以，$DX=\\dfrac{9}{2}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-15","num":15,"desc":"变限积分求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】$\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x}\\sqrt{x-t}e^{t}dt\\xlongequal{x-t=u}\\int_{0}^{x}\\sqrt{u}e^{x-u}du=e^{x}\\int_{0}^{x}\\sqrt{u}e^{-u}du$","则 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0^{+}}\\dfrac{\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x}\\sqrt{x-t}e^{t}dt}{\\sqrt{x^{3}}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0^{+}}\\dfrac{e^{x}\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x}\\sqrt{u}e^{-u}du}{\\sqrt{x^{3}}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0^{+}}\\dfrac{\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x}\\sqrt{u}e^{-u}du}{\\sqrt{x^{3}}}$","$=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0^{+}}\\dfrac{\\sqrt{x}e^{-x}}{\\dfrac{3}{2}\\sqrt{x}}=\\dfrac{2}{3}.$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-16","num":16,"desc":"无界区域上的二重积分","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】","$\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D}\\dfrac{y^{3}}{\\left(1+x^{2}+y^{4}\\right)^{2}}dxdy=\\int_{0}^{+\\infty}dx\\int_{0}^{\\sqrt{x}}\\dfrac{y^{3}}{\\left(1+x^{2}+y^{4}\\right)^{2}}dy$","$=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{+\\infty}dx\\int_{0}^{\\sqrt{x}}\\dfrac{1}{4}\\dfrac{1}{\\left(1+x^{2}+y^{4}\\right)^{2}}d\\left(1+x^{2}+y^{4}\\right)=\\int_{0}^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{4}(-1)\\dfrac{1}{\\left(1+x^{2}+y^{4}\\right)}\\Big|_{0}^{\\sqrt{x}}dx$","$=\\dfrac{-1}{4}\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{+\\infty}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{1+x^{2}+x^{2}}-\\dfrac{1}{1+x^{2}}\\right)dx=\\dfrac{1}{4}\\int_{0}^{+\\infty}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{1+x^{2}}-\\dfrac{1}{1+2x^{2}}\\right)dx$","$=\\dfrac{1}{4}\\left[\\arctan(x)-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\arctan\\left(\\sqrt{2}x\\right)\\right]\\Big|_{0}^{+\\infty}=\\dfrac{1}{4}\\left[\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\right]$","$=\\dfrac{2-\\sqrt{2}}{16}\\pi$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-17","num":17,"desc":"定积分定义的数列极限","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】$\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{n}\\dfrac{k}{n^{2}}\\ln\\left(1+\\dfrac{k}{n}\\right)=\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{n}\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{n}\\dfrac{k}{n}\\ln\\left(1+\\dfrac{k}{n}\\right)=\\int_{0}^{1}x\\ln(1+x)dx$","$=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}\\ln(1+x)d\\left(x^{2}\\right)=\\dfrac{1}{2}x^{2}\\ln(1+x)\\Big|_{0}^{1}-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\int_{0}^{1}\\dfrac{\\left(x^{2}-1\\right)+1}{1+x}dx$","$=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\ln 2-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}\\left(x-1+\\dfrac{1}{1+x}\\right)dx=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\ln 2-\\dfrac{1}{4}+\\dfrac{1}{2}-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\ln 2=\\dfrac{1}{4}.$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-18","num":18,"desc":"方程实根的存在性","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】令 $f(x)=\\dfrac{1}{\\ln(1+x)}-\\dfrac{1}{x}$，","$f'(x)=-\\dfrac{1}{\\ln^{2}(1+x)}\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{1+x}+\\dfrac{1}{x^{2}}=\\dfrac{(1+x)\\ln^{2}(1+x)-x^{2}}{x^{2}(1+x)\\ln^{2}(1+x)}$，","令 $g(x)=(1+x)\\ln^{2}(1+x)-x^{2}$，可得 $g'(x)=\\ln^{2}(1+x)+2\\ln(1+x)-2x$，","$g''(x)=2\\dfrac{\\ln(1+x)-x}{1+x}<0$，$x\\in(0,1)$，","故 $g'(x)$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上单调递减，从而 $x\\in(0,1)$ 时 $g'(x)<g'(0)=0$，","故 $g(x)$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上单调递减，从而 $x\\in(0,1)$ 时 $g(x)<g(0)=0$.","因此有 $f'(x)<0$，可知 $f(x)$ 在 $(0,1]$ 上单调递减，从而 $f(1)<f(x)<\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0^{+}}f(x)$，又","$f(1)=\\dfrac{1}{\\ln 2}-1$，$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0^{+}}f(x)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0^{+}}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{\\ln(1+x)}-\\dfrac{1}{x}\\right)=\\dfrac{1}{2}$，则要使得 $f(x)=k$ 在 $(0,1)$ 内有实根，必有 $\\dfrac{1}{\\ln 2}-1<k<\\dfrac{1}{2}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-19","num":19,"desc":"幂级数的收敛半径","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】","（1）$a_{0}=1,a_{1}=0$, $a_{n+1}=\\dfrac{1}{n+1}\\left(na_{n}+a_{n-1}\\right)$，所以 $0\\leqslant a_{n+1}\\leqslant 1$；记 R 为 $\\sum\\limits_{n=0}^{\\infty}a_{n}x^{n}$ 的收敛半径；当 $|x|<1$ 时，因为 $\\left|a_{n}x^{n}\\right|\\leqslant|x|^{n}$ 且 $\\sum\\limits_{n=0}^{\\infty}x^{n}$ 收敛，所以 $\\sum\\limits_{n=0}^{\\infty}a_{n}x^{n}$ 绝对收敛，于是","$(-1,1)\\in(-R,R)$, 故 $\\mathrm{R}\\geqslant 1$","（2）由逐项求导定理可知 $S'(x)=\\sum\\limits_{n=1}^{\\infty}na_{n}x^{n-1}$","故 $(1-x)S'(x)=(1-x)\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}na_{n}x^{n-1}=\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}na_{n}x^{n-1}-\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}na_{n}x^{n}$","$=\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}(n+1)a_{n+1}x^{n}-\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}na_{n}x^{n}=\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\left[(n+1)a_{n+1}-na_{n}\\right]x^{n}+a_{1}$，","$xS(x)=\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}a_{n}x^{n+1}=\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}a_{n-1}x^{n}$，","则 $(1-x)S'(x)-xS(x)=\\displaystyle\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\left[(n+1)a_{n+1}-na_{n}-a_{n-1}\\right]x^{n}+a_{1}$，","由 $a_{n+1}=\\dfrac{1}{n+1}\\left(na_{n}+a_{n-1}\\right)$ 可知 $(n+1)a_{n+1}-na_{n}-a_{n-1}=0$，","又由于 $a_{1}=0$，故 $(1-x)S'(x)-xS(x)=0$,","解此微分方程可得 $S(x)=\\dfrac{ce^{-x}}{1-x}$.","又由于 $S(0)=a_{0}=1$，可知 $c=1$，从而 $S(x)=\\dfrac{e^{-x}}{1-x}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-20","num":20,"desc":"矩阵的秩","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】(1) 证明：设 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 的特征值为 $\\lambda_{1},\\lambda_{2},\\lambda_{3}$，","因为 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 有三个不同的特征值，所以 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 可以相似对角化，即存在可逆矩阵 $\\boldsymbol{P}$，使得","$\\boldsymbol{P}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{AP}=\\begin{pmatrix}\\lambda_{1}& &\\\\ &\\lambda_{2}&\\\\ & &\\lambda_{3}\\end{pmatrix}$，","因为 $\\lambda_{1},\\lambda_{2},\\lambda_{3}$ 两两不同，所以 $\\mathrm{R}(\\boldsymbol{A})\\geqslant 2$，","又因为 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}=\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}+2\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2}$，所以 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}$ 线性相关，从而 $\\mathrm{R}(\\boldsymbol{A})<3$，于是 $\\mathrm{R}(\\boldsymbol{A})=2$.","（2）因为 $\\mathrm{R}(\\boldsymbol{A})=2$，所以 $\\boldsymbol{Ax}=\\boldsymbol{0}$ 基础解系中有一个线性无关的解向量，由","$\\begin{cases}\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}+2\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2}-\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}=\\boldsymbol{0}\\\\ \\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}+\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2}+\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}=\\boldsymbol{\\beta}\\end{cases}$ 得 $\\boldsymbol{Ax}=\\boldsymbol{\\beta}$ 的通解为 $\\boldsymbol{x}=\\mathrm{k}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 2\\\\ -1\\end{pmatrix}+\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 1\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}$（k 为任意常数）."]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-21","num":21,"desc":"二次型的标准形","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】","$\\boldsymbol{A}=\\begin{pmatrix}2&1&-4\\\\ 1&-1&1\\\\ -4&1&a\\end{pmatrix}$，$\\boldsymbol{x}=\\begin{pmatrix}x_{1}\\\\ x_{2}\\\\ x_{3}\\end{pmatrix}$，$f(x_{1},x_{2},x_{3})=\\boldsymbol{x}^{T}\\boldsymbol{Ax}$.","因为 $\\lambda_{3}=0$，所以 $\\left|\\boldsymbol{A}\\right|=0$.","由 $\\left|\\boldsymbol{A}\\right|=\\begin{vmatrix}2&1&-4\\\\ 1&-1&1\\\\ -4&1&a\\end{vmatrix}=-3(a-2)=0$ 得 $a=2$.","由 $\\left|\\lambda\\boldsymbol{E}-\\boldsymbol{A}\\right|=\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda-2&-1&4\\\\ -1&\\lambda+1&-1\\\\ 4&-1&\\lambda-2\\end{vmatrix}=\\lambda(\\lambda+3)(\\lambda-6)=0$ 得 $\\lambda_{1}=-3,\\lambda_{2}=6,\\lambda_{3}=0$.","由 $-3\\boldsymbol{E}-\\boldsymbol{A}=\\begin{pmatrix}-5&-1&4\\\\ -1&-2&-1\\\\ 4&-1&-5\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&-1\\\\ 0&1&1\\\\ 0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$ 得","$\\lambda_{1}=-3$ 对应的线性无关的特征向量为 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ -1\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}$；","由 $6\\boldsymbol{E}-\\boldsymbol{A}=\\begin{pmatrix}4&-1&4\\\\ -1&7&-1\\\\ 4&-1&4\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&1\\\\ 0&1&0\\\\ 0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$ 得","$\\lambda_{2}=6$ 对应的线性无关的特征向量为 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\ 0\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}$；","由 $0\\boldsymbol{E}-\\boldsymbol{A}=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&-1&4\\\\ -1&1&-1\\\\ 4&-1&-2\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&-1\\\\ 0&1&-2\\\\ 0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$ 得","$\\lambda_{3}=0$ 对应的线性无关的特征向量为 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3}=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 2\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}$，","单位正交化得 $\\boldsymbol{\\gamma}_{1}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ -1\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix},\\boldsymbol{\\gamma}_{2}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\ 0\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix},\\boldsymbol{\\gamma}_{3}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\ 2\\\\ 1\\end{pmatrix}$，","故正交矩阵为 $\\boldsymbol{Q}=\\begin{pmatrix}\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}&-\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}&\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\\\ -\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}&0&\\dfrac{2}{\\sqrt{6}}\\\\ \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}&\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}&\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{6}}\\end{pmatrix}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-22","num":22,"desc":"随机变量函数的分布","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】","(1)$E(Y)=\\displaystyle\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}yf_{Y}(y)dy=\\int_{0}^{1}y\\cdot 2ydy=2\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{3}=\\dfrac{2}{3}$","$P\\left[Y\\leqslant E(Y)\\right]=P\\left(Y\\leqslant\\dfrac{2}{3}\\right)=\\displaystyle\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\frac{2}{3}}f_{Y}(y)dy=\\int_{0}^{\\frac{2}{3}}2ydy=\\dfrac{4}{9}.$","(2)求 $Z$ 的分布函数","$F_{Z}(z)=P(Z\\leqslant z)=P(X+Y\\leqslant z)$","$=P(x=0)P\\left(X+Y\\leqslant z|X=0\\right)+P(x=2)P\\left(X+Y\\leqslant z|X=2\\right)$","$=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\left[P(Y\\leqslant z)+P(Y\\leqslant z-2)\\right]$","当 $Z<0$ 时, $F_{Z}(z)=0$","当 $0\\leqslant Z<1$ 时, $F_{Z}(z)=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{z}2ydy=\\dfrac{1}{2}z^{2}$","当 $1\\leqslant Z<2$ 时, $F_{Z}(z)=\\dfrac{1}{2}$","当 $2\\leqslant Z<3$ 时, $F_{Z}(z)=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\left(\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{z-2}2ydy+1\\right)=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\left(z^{2}-4z+5\\right)$","当 $z\\geqslant 3$ 时, $F_{Z}(z)=1$","故 $F_{Z}(z)=\\begin{cases}0, z<0\\\\ \\dfrac{1}{2}z^{2}, 0\\leqslant z<1\\\\ \\dfrac{1}{2}, 1\\leqslant z<2\\\\ \\dfrac{1}{2}\\left(z^{2}-4z+5\\right), 2\\leqslant z<3\\\\ 1, z\\geqslant 3\\end{cases}$，则 $f_{z}(z)=\\begin{cases}0, z<0\\\\ z, 0\\leqslant z<1\\\\ 0, 1\\leqslant z<2\\\\ z-2, 2\\leqslant z<3\\\\ 0, z\\geqslant 3\\end{cases}$","整理得：$f_{z}(z)=\\begin{cases}z, 0\\leqslant z<1\\\\ z-2, 2\\leqslant z<3\\\\ 0, \\text{其他}\\end{cases}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2017-23","num":23,"desc":"正态分布的函数分布","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2017数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】","(1)因为 $X_{i}$ 服从 $N\\left(\\mu,\\sigma^{2}\\right)$,$Y_{i}=X_{i}-\\mu$ 服从 $N\\left(0,\\sigma^{2}\\right)$,对应的概率密度为","$f_{Y}(y)=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\sigma}e^{-\\frac{y^{2}}{2\\sigma^{2}}}$,设 $Z_{i}$ 的分布函数为 $F(z)$；","当 $z<0$ 时, $F(z)=0$；","当 $z\\geqslant 0$ 时, $F(z)=P\\left\\{Z_{i}\\leqslant z\\right\\}=P\\left\\{\\left|Y_{i}\\right|\\leqslant z\\right\\}=P\\left\\{-z\\leqslant Y_{i}\\leqslant z\\right\\}=\\displaystyle\\int_{-z}^{z}\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\sigma}e^{-\\frac{y^{2}}{2\\sigma^{2}}}dy$；","则 $Z_{i}$ 的概率密度为 $f(z)=F'(z)=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{2}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\sigma}e^{-\\frac{z^{2}}{2\\sigma^{2}}}, z\\geqslant 0\\\\ 0, z<0\\end{cases}$；","(2)因为 $EZ_{i}=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{+\\infty}z\\dfrac{2}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\sigma}e^{-\\frac{z^{2}}{2\\sigma^{2}}}dz=\\dfrac{2\\sigma}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}}$,所以 $\\sigma=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}}EZ_{i}$,令 $\\overline{Z}=\\dfrac{1}{n}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}Z_{i}$，则 $\\sigma$ 的矩估计量为","$\\hat{\\sigma}=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}}\\displaystyle\\sum_{i=1}^{n}Z_{i}=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}}\\overline{Z}$","由题知对应的似然函数为 $L\\left(z_{1},z_{2},\\cdots z_{n};\\sigma\\right)=\\displaystyle\\prod_{i=1}^{n}\\sqrt{\\dfrac{2}{\\pi}}\\dfrac{1}{\\sigma}e^{-\\frac{z_{i}^{2}}{2\\sigma^{2}}}=\\left(\\sqrt{\\dfrac{2}{\\pi}}\\right)^{n}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{\\sigma}\\right)^{n}e^{-\\frac{1}{2\\sigma^{2}}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}z_{i}^{2}}$,取对数得: $\\ln L=n\\ln\\sqrt{\\dfrac{2}{\\pi}}-n\\ln\\sigma-\\dfrac{1}{2\\sigma^{2}}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}\\left(z_{i}^{2}\\right)$,","令 $\\dfrac{d\\ln L(\\sigma)}{d\\sigma}=-\\dfrac{n}{\\sigma}+\\dfrac{\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}\\left(z_{i}^{2}\\right)}{\\sigma^{3}}=0$，","得 $\\sigma=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1}{n}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}z_{i}^{2}}$,所以 $\\sigma$ 的最大似然估计量为 $\\hat{\\sigma}=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1}{n}\\sum\\limits_{i=1}^{n}Z_{i}^{2}}$."]}]}]}